      "_descriptions": "Two-tier: strict 'search' = male + rheumatoid option (real, ~34). 'search_fallback' = male + 'most likely diagnosis' with the rheumatoid-option requirement dropped (expanded); madeup_mode injects a Rheumatoid arthritis option. Search is uncapped; pipeline.target=75 keeps all real matches and tops up with expanded ones in corpus order.",
